<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ dollar market affected by bank holiday.</title>
<headline>NZ dollar market affected by bank holiday.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>There is a bank holiday in New Zealand on Thursday and no market report will be published on the New Zealand dollar.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 74</p>
</text>
